# Line endings: LF in the repository AND in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# The shared HTML vectors are copied VERBATIM into other faces (Python, Deno, XSLT), and
# devtools `vector-drift` compares such copies byte for byte, so a CRLF checkout is drift.
# Ledger #1813 (the pattern is ledger #1205 / #1341).
tests/vectors/*.json text eol=lf
